{"4103090": {"success": true, "data": {"type": "game", "name": "Maloomify the Ocean", "steam_appid": 4103090, "required_age": 0, "is_free": true, "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a small underwater world full of peaceful inhabitants, loving details, and cozy puzzles. In Maloomify The Ocean, you place, rotate, and change different inhabitants and objects until everyone is happy. Each inhabitant has their own personality, so you have to create the perfect balance in the ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everyone is satisfied, your world expands and unlocks new wondrous things. Sit back while you ponder the puzzle and listen to the lo-fi underwater-themed soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the integrated Workshop connection, you can easily create your own levels with the level editor and share them with the world! Whether you want to create beautiful, difficult, or crazy levels, it's entirely up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Micro-games for variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects cannot be changed easily, which means it's time for a micro-game! Micro-games are small events that make your stay underwater more varied and colorful. Of course, everything is done without pressure or stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something new to discover in every corner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you're thinking about how to make everyone happy, you can discover the colorful underwater world. Just click around and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A student project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 students from the Media Informatics and Interactive Entertainment program at Mittweida University of Applied Sciences developed their own game within two semesters. The program teaches game design, computer science, engine, game art, and team management, offering insight into the gaming industry. For more information, visit: <u></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/26209a7ad579bb94cf65e2b9de025fff.avif?t=1774694911\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras_big/26209a7ad579bb94cf65e2b9de025fff.webp?t=1774694911 width=1560 height=778 /></span></p>", "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Relaxing puzzles</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Experience a small underwater world full of peaceful inhabitants, loving details, and cozy puzzles. In Maloomify The Ocean, you place, rotate, and change different inhabitants and objects until everyone is happy. Each inhabitant has their own personality, so you have to create the perfect balance in the ecosystem.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >When everyone is satisfied, your world expands and unlocks new wondrous things. Sit back while you ponder the puzzle and listen to the lo-fi underwater-themed soundtrack.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/ff83d164a29d39f7e21f00f63b8fd749.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Create your own levels</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >With the integrated Workshop connection, you can easily create your own levels with the level editor and share them with the world! Whether you want to create beautiful, difficult, or crazy levels, it's entirely up to you!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/c1114d6d984abc1ba479047b4bfc8d4c.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Micro-games for variety</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Some objects cannot be changed easily, which means it's time for a micro-game! Micro-games are small events that make your stay underwater more varied and colorful. Of course, everything is done without pressure or stress.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.poster.avif?t=1774694911\" width=426 height=240 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.webm?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/6b67b14666493a72f2efc3c978bb584a.mp4?t=1774694911\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Something new to discover in every corner</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >While you're thinking about how to make everyone happy, you can discover the colorful underwater world. Just click around and see what happens!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >A student project</h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >More than 60 students from the Media Informatics and Interactive Entertainment program at Mittweida University of Applied Sciences developed their own game within two semesters. The program teaches game design, computer science, engine, game art, and team management, offering insight into the gaming industry. For more information, visit: <u></u> </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras/26209a7ad579bb94cf65e2b9de025fff.avif?t=1774694911\" data-big-src=https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/extras_big/26209a7ad579bb94cf65e2b9de025fff.webp?t=1774694911 width=1560 height=778 /></span></p>", "short_description": "Maloomify The Ocean is a relaxing puzzle game in which you must fulfill every need of your underwater inhabitants. Each inhabitant has their own personality, so it's important to avoid complications. When all the inhabitants are happy, your game world expands and reveals new, things to discover.", "supported_languages": "German<strong>*</strong>, English<strong>*</strong><br><strong>*</strong>languages with full audio support", "header_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/254bf0f89ea2afcc433a0ef1128de9f236c91e80/header.jpg?t=1774694911", "capsule_image": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/0a790af3a5b12176c8445a4c46dc295a9b269ffb/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1774694911", "capsule_imagev5": "https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/4103090/0a790af3a5b12176c8445a4c46dc295a9b269ffb/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1774694911", "website": "https://games-studieren.hs-mittweida.de/beta/", "pc_requirements": {"minimum": "<strong>Minimum:</strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><strong>OS:</strong> Windows 11<br><